# External data directory for large EEG datasets
#
# Expected structure:
# data_ext4/tusz/ → TUH EEG Seizure Corpus v2.0.3
#   - train/ → Training split EDF files
#   - dev/ → Development/validation split EDF files
#   - _DOCS/ → Official documentation
#
# Other datasets:
# data_ext4/chb-mit/ → CHB-MIT Scalp EEG Database
# data_ext4/siena-scalp-eeg-database-1.0.0/ → Siena dataset
#
# ⚠️ WSL2 NOTE:
# This directory can safely be on Windows drives (/mnt/c/, /mnt/d/).
# Raw EDF files are read sequentially (no mmap), so no SIGBUS issues.
# Only memory-mapped cache (cache/tusz_mmap/) needs native ext4 filesystem!
#
# The actual data files are excluded by .gitignore
# This .gitkeep ensures the directory structure is documented in git
